- Privacy notice and consent ([PR #75](https://github.com/ALFRED-LUCIFER/medvya/pull/75)): the demo form shows the same notice (purpose: to contact you about a demo) and required consent box as the waitlist; refused on the server without it and nothing is stored or emailed; ConsentedAt and NoticeVersion stored (new forward-only Leads migration); retention "2 years, then deleted" decided in the retention map; policy dates stay "Not yet in effect" until the company adopts each policy after counsel review
- Left: final policy and sub-processor text and dates after legal review (MDV-P1-044); the real privacy contact address and counsel-reviewed notice wording (MDV-P1-044); transactional email provider instead of SMTP; back-office view of requests (P5); automated retention (MDV-P5-025)
