- Open [PR #68](https://github.com/ALFRED-LUCIFER/medvya/pull/68): the per-user search, record and duplicate-check limits ran in the rate-limiting middleware before authentication and keyed everyone as anonymous; they are now endpoint filters after sign-in, tested with a real authentication handler (old ordering fails the tests); another facility's record is audited NotFound, not Allowed; X-Forwarded-For only from listed proxies
- Follow-ups outside this ticket: read-volume alert with the practice access log (MDV-P1-035); cross-facility patients within a tenant (P7); doctor ⌘K overlay (D-02, P2)
