sources: docs/02-design/source/Medvya Patient Registration (Family & emergency)
desc:
PATIENT_RELATIONSHIP: emergency contact name, relationship, phone (required for full registration), guardian (required when age < 18; UAE: guardian/sponsor for dependants). Note shown: emergency contacts get no portal access; caregiver access is via patient-authorised proxy (P4 R-04).
ac:
- When DOB indicates age < 18, guardian becomes required and save is blocked without it.
- Emergency contact is required for full registration but not for quick registration.
- Emergency contacts never receive portal access or patient data (no account is created).
- Relationship values are country-specific (UAE includes Sponsor).

