desc:
"Walk-in" on the board: find or quick-register the patient, choose doctor (or "next available"), create an appointment in the next free slot or as an unscheduled walk-in, and check in immediately; card tagged Walk-in. Timing a trained receptionist at under 60 seconds is an acceptance criterion of MDV-P1-040, which owns reception training at the pilot (owner decision 10 Nov 2026).
ac:
- If no slot is free, the walk-in is queued without breaking the no-double-booking rule (unscheduled walk-ins do not occupy slots).
- Walk-ins appear in the Checked in column with wait time and the Walk-in tag.

